     <DIV style="BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: #e7e7eb 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 7pt; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 0cm; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; PADDING-RIGHT: 0cm; mso-element: para-border-div; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid #E7E7EB .75pt">
<H2 style="BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; TEXT-ALIGN: center; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 0cm; MARGIN: auto 0cm 10.5pt; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; PADDING-RIGHT: 0cm; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid #E7E7EB .75pt; mso-line-height-alt: 1.05pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-padding-alt: 0cm 0cm 7.0pt 0cm" align=center><FONT face=宋体><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: -apple-system-font; BACKGROUND: white; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; mso-fareast-font-family: -apple-system-font; mso-bidi-font-family: -apple-system-font">那一年，习近平的高考</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"><?xml:namespace prefix = "o" ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></H2></DIV>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 3.75pt 6pt 3.75pt 0cm; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; LINE-HEIGHT: 18.4pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3 face=Calibri>1975</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin"><FONT size=3>年还没恢复高考那会儿，清华大学有两个名额分配到延安地区，分给了延川县。那时在延川县下乡的习近平成绩非常优秀，只因家庭出身特殊，他的高考变得一波三折。</FONT></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 3.75pt 6pt; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; LINE-HEIGHT: 18.4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin"><FONT size=3>后来，习近平在《我是黄土地的儿子》一文中回忆道：</FONT></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 3.75pt 42pt; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; LINE-HEIGHT: 18.4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体"><FONT size=3>我三个志愿都填清华，你让我上就上，不让我上就拉倒。县里将我报到地区，县教育局领导仗义执言为我力争。清华来招生的人不敢做主，请示学校……当时，我父亲下放的洛阳耐火材料厂，开了个“土证明”：“习仲勋同志属人民内部矛盾，不影响子女升学就业。”开了这么个证明，就上学了。走的时候，当地还剩下的一些知青都特别羡慕我。那些知青也都没得说，一恢复高考，都考上了学，还都是前几名。</FONT></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 3.75pt 6pt; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; LINE-HEIGHT: 18.4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3 face=Calibri>2003</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin"><FONT size=3>年</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3 face=Calibri>7</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin"><FONT size=3>月</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3 face=Calibri>11</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin"><FONT size=3>日，恰逢高考录取揭榜之际，时任浙江省委书记的习近平在《浙江日报》的《之江新语》专栏发表《路就在脚下》一文，文章提到：</FONT></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 3.75pt 42pt; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; LINE-HEIGHT: 18.4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体"><FONT size=3>又到了高考录取揭榜的时候。考上大学固然可喜，但没考上大学也不用悲观，更不能绝望。路就在脚下。一个人能否成才，关键不在于是否上大学，而在于他的实际本领。社会本身就是一个大学校，留心处处皆学问。只要你肯学习、能吃苦，没有读过大学，照样能成才。</FONT></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 3.75pt 6pt; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; LINE-HEIGHT: 18.4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3 face=Calibri>2011</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin"><FONT size=3>年</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3 face=Calibri>8</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin"><FONT size=3>月</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3 face=Calibri>21</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin"><FONT size=3>日，时任国家副主席的习近平参观四川都江堰市青城山高级中学，用一句歌词</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3 face=Calibri>“</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin"><FONT size=3>不经历风雨，怎能见彩虹</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3 face=Calibri>”</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin"><FONT size=3>和一句古诗</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3 face=Calibri>“</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin"><FONT size=3>不经一番寒彻骨，怎得梅花扑鼻香</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3 face=Calibri>”</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin"><FONT size=3>来勉励高三学子。</FONT></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 3.75pt 6pt; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; LINE-HEIGHT: 18.4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3 face=Calibri>2013</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin"><FONT size=3>年</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3 face=Calibri>5</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin"><FONT size=3>月</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3 face=Calibri>4</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin"><FONT size=3>日，习近平在同各界优秀青年代表座谈时谈起了自己的插队经历，同时也是自己别样的</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3 face=Calibri>“</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin"><FONT size=3>备战高考</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3 face=Calibri>”</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin"><FONT size=3>状态：</FONT></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 3.75pt 42pt; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; LINE-HEIGHT: 18.4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体"><FONT size=3>上山放羊，我揣着书，把羊圈在山坡上，就开始看书。锄地到田头，开始休息一会儿时，我就拿出新华字典记一个字的多种含义，一点一滴积累。</FONT></SPAN></P>
<DIV style="BORDER-TOP: #007aaa 1pt; BORDER-RIGHT: #007aaa 1pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #007aaa 1pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 0cm; BORDER-LEFT: #007aaa 1pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 0cm; mso-element: para-border-div; mso-border-alt: none #007AAA 0cm">
<P style="BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 0cm; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; PADDING-RIGHT: 0cm; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-padding-alt: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm; mso-border-alt: none #007AAA 0cm"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin"><FONT size=3>凭借自己的刻苦努力，青年时的习近平圆梦清华。那么对于今天的莘莘学子以及年轻人，习近平又有哪些寄语呢？</FONT></SPAN></P></DIV>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" align=left><STRONG><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-language: AR">树立与这个时代主题同心同向的理想信念</SPAN></STRONG></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 3.75pt 6pt; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; LINE-HEIGHT: 18.4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin"><FONT size=3>当代青年要树立与这个时代主题同心同向的理想信念，勇于担当这个时代赋予的历史责任，励志勤学、刻苦磨炼，在激情奋斗中绽放青春光芒、健康成长进步。</FONT></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: right; MARGIN: 3.75pt 6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18.4pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" align=right><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin"><FONT size=3>　　</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3 face=Calibri>——2017</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin"><FONT size=3>年</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3 face=Calibri>5</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin"><FONT size=3>月</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3 face=Calibri>3</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin"><FONT size=3>日，习近平在中国政法大学考察时强调</FONT></SPAN></P>
