<P style="BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 0cm; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; PADDING-RIGHT: 0cm; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-padding-alt: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm; mso-border-alt: none #007AAA 0cm"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin"><FONT size=3>频繁用典背后的理念表达</FONT></SPAN></P></DIV>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0cm 6pt 0pt; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; LINE-HEIGHT: 18.4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin"><FONT size=3>在习近平讲话文章中，一些典故还被频繁引用，说明这些典故有着深厚内涵的理念表达和十分重要的指导意义。</FONT></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0cm 6pt 0pt; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; LINE-HEIGHT: 18.4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3 face=Calibri>“</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin"><FONT size=3>大道之行也，天下为公。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3 face=Calibri>”</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin"><FONT size=3>是习近平引用频率最高的一则典故，达</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3 face=Calibri>13</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin"><FONT size=3>次之多，多用于对于中国外交政策的阐述，旨在打造人类命运共同体。习近平所讲的</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3 face=Calibri>“</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin"><FONT size=3>天下</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3 face=Calibri>”</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin"><FONT size=3>与前人的理解有很大不同。古代中国的</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3 face=Calibri>“</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin"><FONT size=3>天下观</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3 face=Calibri>”</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin"><FONT size=3>指的是</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3 face=Calibri>“</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin"><FONT size=3>普天之下</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3 face=Calibri>”</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin"><FONT size=3>，其基本主张是</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3 face=Calibri>“</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin"><FONT size=3>天下一家，中国居中</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3 face=Calibri>”</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin"><FONT size=3>。而今天的</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3 face=Calibri>“</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin"><FONT size=3>天下</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3 face=Calibri>”</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin"><FONT size=3>是指全世界，中国是人类命运共同体的一员；</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3 face=Calibri>“</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin"><FONT size=3>大道</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3 face=Calibri>”</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin"><FONT size=3>则是全人类共同追求的</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3 face=Calibri>“</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin"><FONT size=3>公平正义</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3 face=Calibri>”</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin"><FONT size=3>等价值。正如习近平在第七十届联合国大会上指出：</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3 face=Calibri>“‘</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin"><FONT size=3>大道之行也，天下为公。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3 face=Calibri>’</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin"><FONT size=3>和平、发展、公平、正义、民主、自由是全人类的共同价值，也是联合国的崇高目标。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3 face=Calibri>”</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin"><FONT size=3>其蕴含的内容更深邃、更宽广，体现了广阔的世界眼光和人类胸怀。</FONT></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0cm 6pt 0pt; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; LINE-HEIGHT: 18.4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3 face=Calibri>“</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin"><FONT size=3>衙斋卧听萧萧竹，疑是民间疾苦声。些小吾曹州县吏，一枝一叶总关情。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3 face=Calibri>”</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin"><FONT size=3>郑板桥的这首著名题画诗，习近平在讲话文章中曾</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3 face=Calibri>6</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin"><FONT size=3>次引用，以此说明群众利益无小事，民生问题大于天。他谆谆教导各级干部：</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3 face=Calibri>“</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin"><FONT size=3>我们共产党人对人民群众的疾苦更要有这样的情怀，要有仁爱之心、关爱之心，更多关注困难群众，不断提高全体人民生活水平。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3 face=Calibri>”</FONT></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0cm 6pt 0pt; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; LINE-HEIGHT: 18.4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin"><FONT size=3>老子的</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3 face=Calibri>“</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin"><FONT size=3>以百姓心为心</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3 face=Calibri>”</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin"><FONT size=3>，习近平在讲话文章中曾</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3 face=Calibri>4</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin"><FONT size=3>次引用。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3 face=Calibri> </FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin"><FONT size=3>早在</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3 face=Calibri>1989</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin"><FONT size=3>年福建工作期间，就在《干部的基本功</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3 face=Calibri>——</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin"><FONT size=3>密切联系人民群众》（见《摆脱贫困》）中说：</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3 face=Calibri>“</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin"><FONT size=3>只要我们能真正代表人民的根本利益，</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3 face=Calibri>‘</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin"><FONT size=3>以百姓之心为心</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3 face=Calibri>’</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin"><FONT size=3>，我们的周围就会吸引和凝聚起千百万大众，还愁什么社会不稳？！</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3 face=Calibri>” 2007</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin"><FONT size=3>年又在《主仆关系不容颠倒》（见《之江新语》）一文中写道：</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3 face=Calibri>“</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin"><FONT size=3>古人也常讲，</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3 face=Calibri>‘</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin"><FONT size=3>圣人无常心，以百姓之心为心</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3 face=Calibri>’</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin"><FONT size=3>；</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3 face=Calibri>‘</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin"><FONT size=3>德莫高于爱民，行莫贱于害民</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3 face=Calibri>’</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin"><FONT size=3>。各级领导干部要一切从人民的利益出发，站在人民群众的立场上立身、处世、从政，真正做到权为民所用、情为民所系、利为民所谋。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3 face=Calibri>”2014</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin"><FONT size=3>年在国庆</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3 face=Calibri>65</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin"><FONT size=3>周年招待会上，习近平发出号召：</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3 face=Calibri>“</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin"><FONT size=3>我们要坚持</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3 face=Calibri>‘</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin"><FONT size=3>以百姓心为心</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3 face=Calibri>’</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin"><FONT size=3>，倾听人民心声，汲取人民智慧，始终把实现好、维护好、发展好最广大人民根本利益作为一切工作的出发点和落脚点，让发展成果更多更公平惠及全体人民。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3 face=Calibri>”</FONT></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0cm 6pt 0pt; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; LINE-HEIGHT: 18.4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin"><FONT size=3>老子的</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3 face=Calibri>“</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin"><FONT size=3>以百姓心为心</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3 face=Calibri>”</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin"><FONT size=3>，对习近平治国理政思想影响甚大。习近平十八大同中外记者见面时所说的</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3 face=Calibri>“</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin"><FONT size=3>人民对美好生活的向往，就是我们的奋斗目标</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3 face=Calibri>”</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin"><FONT size=3>，就是对</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3 face=Calibri>“</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin"><FONT size=3>以百姓心为心</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3 face=Calibri>”</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin"><FONT size=3>的现代解读与应用。可见，习近平用典的背后是</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3 face=Calibri>“</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin"><FONT size=3>治世</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3 face=Calibri>”</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin"><FONT size=3>，从中国传统文化中汲取治国理政的智慧，是习近平用典的真正目的。</FONT></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: justify; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; LINE-HEIGHT: 18.4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin"><FONT size=3>杨立新，新闻学、书法学双博士，《习近平用典》典故释义作者，《学习时报》</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3 face=Calibri>“</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin"><FONT size=3>用典释义</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3 face=Calibri>”</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin"><FONT size=3>专栏作者。现为人民日报总编室一读室主任，高级编辑。出版有</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3 face=Calibri>5</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin"><FONT size=3>部学术专著，发表各类学术论文四百余篇。</FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" align=left><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT size=3 face=Calibri> </FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<DIV style="BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: #e7e7eb 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 7pt; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 0cm; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; PADDING-RIGHT: 0cm; mso-element: para-border-div; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid #E7E7EB .75pt">
<H2 style="BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; TEXT-ALIGN: center; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 0cm; MARGIN: auto 0cm 10.5pt; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; PADDING-RIGHT: 0cm; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid #E7E7EB .75pt; mso-line-height-alt: 1.05pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-padding-alt: 0cm 0cm 7.0pt 0cm" align=center><FONT face=宋体><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16.5pt; BACKGROUND: white; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">新时代，“大朋友”习近平这样寄语小朋友</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16.5pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></H2></DIV>
<P style="MARGIN-BOTTOM: 7.5pt; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; LINE-HEIGHT: 21pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; BACKGROUND: white; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">在“六一”国际儿童节来临之际，中共中央总书记、国家主席、中央军委主席习近平<SPAN lang=EN-US>5</SPAN>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>30</SPAN>日给陕西照金北梁红军小学的学生回信，祝他们和全国各族少年儿童节日快乐。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="MARGIN-BOTTOM: 7.5pt; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; LINE-HEIGHT: 21pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; BACKGROUND: white; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">时间的钟摆回拨到五年前的“六一”国际儿童节，习近平以一个“大朋友”的名义，向全国少年儿童祝贺节日。五年来，从北京市少年宫到人民大会堂，“大朋友”习近平和小朋友们共度“六一”儿童节、寄语全国少年儿童，成为孩子们珍贵的人生记忆。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="MARGIN-BOTTOM: 7.5pt; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; LINE-HEIGHT: 21pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; BACKGROUND: white; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">不管是在呼和浩特市儿童福利院、云南鲁甸地震灾区安置点还是新疆疏附县托克扎克镇中心小学，都留下了习近平和孩子们在一起的一个个温暖、感人的瞬间，承载着习近平对培养担当民族复兴大任的时代新人的殷切希望。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" align=center><STRONG><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; BACKGROUND: white; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">“要从小学习做人”</SPAN></STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" align=center><STRONG><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; BACKGROUND: white; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">——殷殷寄语关切少年儿童品德的培育</SPAN></STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="MARGIN-BOTTOM: 7.5pt; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; LINE-HEIGHT: 21pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; BACKGROUND: white; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">“现在把自己的品德培育得越好，将来人就能做得越好。”在习近平看来，少年儿童的成长要坚持品德为先。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="MARGIN-BOTTOM: 7.5pt; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; LINE-HEIGHT: 21pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; BACKGROUND: white; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">十年树木，百年树人。习近平将少年儿童比作是“小树苗”，曾寄语全国各族少年儿童“要从小学习做人”。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="MARGIN-BOTTOM: 7.5pt; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; LINE-HEIGHT: 21pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; BACKGROUND: white; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">作为孩子们的“大朋友”，习近平曾通过讲述自己儿时的故事感染孩子们。<SPAN lang=EN-US>2017</SPAN>年，习近平察看<SPAN lang=EN-US>2022</SPAN>年北京冬奥会冰球比赛场馆时给中关村二小雄鹰冰球队的冰球小队员讲述了自己儿时滑冰的故事：小时候条件有限，只能在简陋的户外冰场滑冰。习近平和弟弟都喜欢滑冰，但手上的钱只够买一双冰鞋，他便把买冰鞋的机会让给了弟弟。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="MARGIN-BOTTOM: 7.5pt; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; LINE-HEIGHT: 21pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; BACKGROUND: white; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">习近平殷切叮嘱孩子们珍惜现在的条件，通过参与运动，锻炼和培养坚强的性格。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="MARGIN-BOTTOM: 7.5pt; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; LINE-HEIGHT: 21pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; BACKGROUND: white; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">学习做人，要树立正确的劳动观和幸福观。<SPAN lang=EN-US>2013</SPAN>年<SPAN lang=EN-US>5</SPAN>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>29</SPAN>日，习近平在北京市少年宫参加主题队日活动时对孩子们说：“生活靠劳动创造，人生也靠劳动创造。”<SPAN lang=EN-US>2015</SPAN>年<SPAN lang=EN-US>6</SPAN>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>日，习近平在会见中国少年先锋队第七次全国代表大会代表时，告诉孩子们：“幸福不是毛毛雨，幸福不是免费午餐，幸福不会从天而降。人世间的一切成就、一切幸福都源于劳动和创造。”</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="MARGIN-BOTTOM: 7.5pt; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; LINE-HEIGHT: 21pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; BACKGROUND: white; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">学习做人要热爱党、热爱祖国、热爱人民。<SPAN lang=EN-US>2016</SPAN>年<SPAN lang=EN-US>5</SPAN>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>30</SPAN>日，习近平给大陈岛老垦荒队员的后代、浙江省台州市椒江区<SPAN lang=EN-US>12</SPAN>名小学生回信中指出：“希望你们向爷爷奶奶学习，热爱党、热爱祖国、热爱人民，努力成长为有知识、有品德、有作为的新一代建设者，准备着为实现中华民族伟大复兴的中国梦贡献力量。”</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" align=center><STRONG><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; BACKGROUND: white; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">“你们是未来的主力军、生力军”</SPAN></STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" align=center><STRONG><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; BACKGROUND: white; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">——恳切嘱托对少年儿童的未来寄予厚望</SPAN></STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="MARGIN-BOTTOM: 7.5pt; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; LINE-HEIGHT: 21pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; BACKGROUND: white; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">少年儿童是祖国的未来，是中华民族的希望。近年来，习近平曾多次表达对少年儿童未来发展的嘱托，希望他们长大后做对祖国建设有用的人才。在给陕西照金北梁红军小学的学生回信中，习近平勉励孩子们珍惜时光，努力学习，将来做对国家、对人民、对社会有用的人。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="MARGIN-BOTTOM: 7.5pt; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; LINE-HEIGHT: 21pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; BACKGROUND: white; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">习近平鼓励少年儿童要敢于有梦、立远大志向。<SPAN lang=EN-US>2013</SPAN>年<SPAN lang=EN-US>5</SPAN>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>21</SPAN>日，习近平在四川芦山地震灾区看望慰问受灾群众期间曾鼓励当地的孩子们要敢于有梦，“有梦想，还要脚踏实地，好好读书，才能梦想成真。”<SPAN lang=EN-US>2015</SPAN>年的儿童节，习近平在中国少年先锋队第七次全国代表大会上强调，志向是人生的航标。一个人要做出一番成就，就要有自己的志向。一个人可以有很多志向，但人生最重要的志向应该同祖国和人民联系在一起，这是人们各种具体志向的底盘，也是人生的脊梁。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="MARGIN-BOTTOM: 7.5pt; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; LINE-HEIGHT: 21pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; BACKGROUND: white; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">少年儿童的美好未来离不开知识的学习。“想象力、创造力从哪里来？要从刻苦的学习中来”，<SPAN lang=EN-US>2013</SPAN>年<SPAN lang=EN-US>5</SPAN>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>29</SPAN>日，习近平在北京市少年宫嘱咐孩子们要认识到学习的重要性，“知识越学越多，知识越多越好，你们要像海绵吸水一样学习知识。既勤学书本知识，又多学课外知识，还要勤于思考，多想想，多问问，这样就能培养自己的创造精神。”</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="MARGIN-BOTTOM: 7.5pt; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; LINE-HEIGHT: 21pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; BACKGROUND: white; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">习近平经常鼓励孩子们，要德智体美全面发展。<SPAN lang=EN-US>2017</SPAN>年<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>23</SPAN>日，习近平在崇礼区云顶滑雪场考察北京冬奥会筹办工作，他嘱咐参加滑雪冬令营的“冰雪少年”们在滑雪运动中既勇于挑战，又注意安全。习近平强调冰雪运动要从孩子抓起，希望将来能从他们中间出现一批优秀运动员。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" align=center><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体"><o:p><FONT size=3> </FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" align=center><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; BACKGROUND: white; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">2017</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; BACKGROUND: white; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">年<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>23</SPAN>日，中共中央总书记、国家主席、中央军委主席习近平在河北省张家口市考察北京冬奥会筹办工作。这是习近平在云顶滑雪场亲切勉励参加滑雪冬令营的少年儿童。新华社记者李涛 摄</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: justify; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><STRONG><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; BACKGROUND: white; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">“孩子们成长得更好，是我们最大的心愿”</SPAN></STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: justify; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><STRONG><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; BACKGROUND: white; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">——切实举措让全社会提供良好成长环境</SPAN></STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="MARGIN-BOTTOM: 7.5pt; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; LINE-HEIGHT: 21pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; BACKGROUND: white; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">“孩子们成长得更好，是我们最大的心愿。党和政府要始终关心各族少年儿童，努力为他们学习成长创造更好的条件。老师、家长要承担起教育引导少年儿童成长成才的责任。少先队组织要更好地为少年儿童服务。全社会都要关心少年儿童成长，支持少年儿童工作。”<SPAN lang=EN-US>2013</SPAN>年，习近平在北京少年宫参加主题队日活动时强调。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="MARGIN-BOTTOM: 7.5pt; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; LINE-HEIGHT: 21pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; BACKGROUND: white; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">习近平对儿童的关怀，不仅有谆谆教导，更落实在涉及儿童权益的改革措施中。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="MARGIN-BOTTOM: 7.5pt; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; LINE-HEIGHT: 21pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; BACKGROUND: white; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">2016</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; BACKGROUND: white; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">年<SPAN lang=EN-US>3</SPAN>月，习近平主持召开中央全面深化改革领导小组第二十二次会议。会议指出，儿童健康事关家庭幸福和民族未来。加强儿童医疗卫生服务改革与发展，要紧紧围绕加强儿科医务人员培养和队伍建设、完善儿童医疗卫生服务体系、推进儿童医疗卫生服务领域改革、防治结合提高服务质量等关键问题，系统设计改革路径，切实缓解儿童医疗服务资源短缺问题。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="MARGIN-BOTTOM: 7.5pt; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; LINE-HEIGHT: 21pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; BACKGROUND: white; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">保障少年儿童身心健康发展，教育和医疗同等重要。在<SPAN lang=EN-US>2015</SPAN>年到陕西杨家岭福州希望小学考察时，习近平强调，革命老区、贫困地区要脱贫致富，从根儿上还是要把教育抓好，不能让孩子输在起跑线上。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="MARGIN-BOTTOM: 3.8pt; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; LINE-HEIGHT: 21pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; BACKGROUND: white; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">“一个民族的文明进步，一个国家的发展壮大，需要一代又一代人接力努力。”<SPAN lang=EN-US>2014</SPAN>年<SPAN lang=EN-US>5</SPAN>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>30</SPAN>日，习近平在北京市海淀区民族小学主持召开座谈会时谈到，“我相信，今天这一代少年儿童一定能立志向、有梦想，爱学习、爱劳动、爱祖国，从小自觉培育和践行社会主义核心价值观，在星星火炬的照耀下，在党的阳光的沐浴下，为实现中华民族伟大复兴的中国梦时刻准备着。<SPAN lang=EN-US> </SPAN>”（作者：王政淇 刘婧婷）<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="MARGIN-BOTTOM: 3.8pt; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; LINE-HEIGHT: 21pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; BACKGROUND: white; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体"><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></P>
<H3 style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 3.8pt 0cm auto; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" align=center><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: "微软雅黑","sans-serif"; BACKGROUND: white; COLOR: #333333; mso-bidi-font-family: 微软雅黑'>拥抱大湾区 发展大绍兴 ——马卫光在首届绍兴发展大会上的主旨演讲</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: "微软雅黑","sans-serif"; COLOR: #333333; mso-bidi-font-family: 微软雅黑'><o:p></o:p></SPAN></H3>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 7.6pt 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 26.25pt; TEXT-INDENT: -18pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 36.0pt" align=center><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-size: 13.5pt"><SPAN style="mso-list: Ignore">·<SPAN style='FONT: 7pt "Times New Roman"'>         </SPAN></SPAN></SPAN><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt"><o:p><FONT face=Calibri> </FONT></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 3.8pt 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 26.25pt; TEXT-INDENT: -18pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: 36.0pt" align=center><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt"><SPAN style="mso-list: Ignore">·<SPAN style='FONT: 7pt "Times New Roman"'>         </SPAN></SPAN></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol">·</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体"><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">  </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: "微软雅黑","sans-serif"; BACKGROUND: white; COLOR: #040404; mso-bidi-font-family: 微软雅黑; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt'><FONT size=3>来源：绍兴日报</FONT><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3>     </FONT></SPAN><FONT size=3>发布时间：</FONT><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3>2018-06-04</FONT></SPAN></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<DIV style="BORDER-TOP: #e2e2e2 1pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #e2e2e2 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: #e2e2e2 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 7pt; PADDING-TOP: 7pt; PADDING-LEFT: 28pt; BORDER-LEFT: #e2e2e2 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 28pt; mso-element: para-border-div; mso-border-alt: solid #E2E2E2 .75pt">
<P class=MsoNormal style="BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; TEXT-ALIGN: left; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 0cm; MARGIN: 3.75pt 0cm 0pt; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; LINE-HEIGHT: 22.5pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 0cm; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-padding-alt: 7.0pt 28.0pt 7.0pt 28.0pt; mso-border-alt: solid #E2E2E2 .75pt" align=left><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; BACKGROUND: white; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-language: AR">尊敬的各位领导、各位来宾、各位乡贤，</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P></DIV>
<P style="BACKGROUND: white; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; MARGIN-TOP: 7.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 22.5pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; BACKGROUND: white; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">　　女士们、先生们、朋友们：</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="BACKGROUND: white; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; MARGIN-TOP: 7.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 22.5pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; BACKGROUND: white; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">　　大家上午好！</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="BACKGROUND: white; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; MARGIN-TOP: 7.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 22.5pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; BACKGROUND: white; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">　　孟夏之月，越都水城，草长莺飞，碧荷映天。首届绍兴发展大会今天隆重开幕了！<SPAN lang=EN-US>1000</SPAN>余位越商、乡贤和海内外朋友，怀着家书的浓情邀约，乘着新时代的浩荡东风，汇聚故里，共叙老乡情谊，共鉴家乡巨变，共绘美好愿景。首先，我谨代表中共浙江省绍兴市委、市人大、市政府、市政协和<SPAN lang=EN-US>500</SPAN>余万家乡人民，向各位新老乡贤和朋友们的到来，表示最热烈的欢迎！向海内外绍兴人和支持绍兴发展的各界人士，致以最诚挚的问候！</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="BACKGROUND: white; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; MARGIN-TOP: 7.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 22.5pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; BACKGROUND: white; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">　　绍兴是一方充满灵气的土地，这里孕育了一代又一代名人贤士，演绎了一个又一个文化和商业传奇，创造了厚重的历史文化和辉煌的商业文明。绍兴的文明史源远流长，<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>万多年前我们的先民就在这片大地上生活，<SPAN lang=EN-US>4000</SPAN>多年前大禹在绍兴平定洪荒、会盟诸侯，<SPAN lang=EN-US>2500</SPAN>多年前越王勾践卧薪尝胆、终成霸业。千百年来，一代一代越国儿女接续推动寻梦、追梦、圆梦的历史进程，创造了独具魅力的“越文化”，为华夏文明贡献了大禹文化、阳明文化、书法文化、越剧文化、黄酒文化、会计文化、师爷文化等璀璨瑰宝。深厚的历史文化底蕴哺育了一大批引领时代潮流的杰出人物，涌现了以大思想家王阳明、大书法家王羲之、大书画家徐渭、大文学家陆游、大文化家鲁迅、大教育家蔡元培、大科学家钱三强等为代表的名人大家，前不久刚刚举办建校<SPAN lang=EN-US>120</SPAN>周年校庆的北大，先后有<SPAN lang=EN-US>4</SPAN>位绍兴籍人士担任校长、管理学校达<SPAN lang=EN-US>37</SPAN>年之久，当今两院院士中有<SPAN lang=EN-US>70</SPAN>多位绍兴籍科学家。与此同时，这方土地也孕育萌发了许多商业思想，“商圣”范蠡以“农末俱利”“平粜齐物”“散财济民”等理念治理越国经济，宋代事功学派倡导“农商并重”“义利并举”，明清浙东学派提出“工商皆本”“经世致用”，等等。这些思想融入“越文化”之中，使古越大地始终保持浓厚的经商传统，产生了发达的工商经济，从两汉三国的会稽铜镜、麻布，到唐宋期间的越窑青瓷、绫罗，再到明清以来的布业、药业会馆和染缸、酱缸、酒缸，中国商业发展的每个历史时期都有绍兴一席之地。新时代新阶段新征程，我们召开首届绍兴发展大会，就是要传承弘扬千百年来赓续不绝的文化传统和商业基因，汇聚天下绍兴人的巨大能量，拥抱大湾区、发展大绍兴，不断把绍兴的历史文化和商业文明推向新的高度。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="BACKGROUND: white; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; MARGIN-TOP: 7.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 22.5pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; BACKGROUND: white; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">　　历代越国儿女创造了千年绍兴的辉煌历史，当今大湾区经济时代，我们期待广大越商、乡贤和新绍兴人把握历史机遇，携手谱写新时代发展新篇章。历代越国儿女栉风沐雨、筚路蓝缕，创造了古代和近代绍兴的商业文明、文化财富，激励着当代绍兴人开拓进取、砥砺奋进。改革开放以来，无数绍兴“弄潮儿”走南闯北、漂洋过海，办实体、兴产业、闯码头、拓市场，创造了一个个创业奇迹，涌现了一批批商界精英，塑造了越商这个老品牌的新形象，在我国改革开放进程中书写了浓墨重彩的一笔。今天，<SPAN lang=EN-US>100</SPAN>多万绍兴人在外闯荡打拼，<SPAN lang=EN-US>50</SPAN>余万市内市场主体、<SPAN lang=EN-US>4500</SPAN>余家规上企业、<SPAN lang=EN-US>70</SPAN>余家上市公司和近<SPAN lang=EN-US>8</SPAN>万家市外企业，在世界经济舞台上同国际巨头角力争锋，在科技、金融、人文各领域独领风骚，在新时代最前沿向全世界展示中国风范、绍兴风采。去年全市地区生产总值达到<SPAN lang=EN-US>5108</SPAN>亿元，居全国城市第<SPAN lang=EN-US>36</SPAN>位，在资源能源双重缺乏的困难条件下，以全国万分之八的国土面积，创造了全国千分之六强的生产总值。取得这样巨大成就的重要支撑，就是绍兴人的情怀和精神，从大禹不获全胜不收兵的治水精神、勾践“卧薪尝胆”的奋斗精神、陆游“绝知此事要躬行”的实践精神，到鲁迅“横眉冷对千夫指”的战斗精神、周恩来总理“道义争担敢息肩”的担当精神，再到改革开放以来广大越商的“四千四万”精神，绍兴精神代代相传，凝结成了绍兴人坚韧不拔、奋发图强、创业创新、善作善成的优秀品质，推动绍兴实现了从“会稽山时代”向“镜湖时代”的根本性转变，从资源小市向经济大市的历史性跨越，正在向“杭州湾时代”、现代化强市大踏步迈进。去年，省第十四次党代会作出建设大湾区的重大决策，前不久通过的大湾区建设行动计划，明确把绍兴滨海新区作为环杭州湾四大经济新区之一，大湾区将成为今后高端要素竞争的主战场、中国制造<SPAN lang=EN-US>2025</SPAN>的主阵地、地区经济的增长极和技术产业创新的主引擎。处在杭州湾南湾地理中心、杭州宁波都市区一体化同城化发展锚接地的绍兴，正迎来前所未有的历史性机遇。我们召开首届绍兴发展大会，就是要大力弘扬绍兴精神，牢牢把握机遇，永葆大气包容的胸怀格局，永葆敢创伟业的雄心壮志，永葆克难攻坚的创业激情，携手再造绍兴新优势、再创发展新辉煌。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="BACKGROUND: white; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; MARGIN-TOP: 7.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 22.5pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; BACKGROUND: white; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">　　绍兴正行进在高质量发展的新征程上，我们热忱邀请海内外绍兴人投身家乡建设，与大绍兴同成长共进步。党的十九大擘画了全面建成社会主义现代化强国的宏伟蓝图，省委明确了浙江“两个高水平”建设的战略安排，发出了推动高质量发展的动员令。对照新时代新要求，我们清醒认识到，如果不能在更高水平上对绍兴发展进行更深层次的谋划，不能加快解决发展不平衡不充分问题、加快突破产业发展“天花板”、加快走出“成长的烦恼”，绍兴发展就可能掉队落伍。为此，市委以习近平新时代中国特色社会主义思想为指导，认真贯彻落实党的十九大精神，根据中央和省委决策部署，沿着“八八战略”指引的路子，提出了加快推动高质量发展、建设现代化强市的目标思路和主要任务。未来五年，绍兴在产业优化升级方面，将重点念好“两业经”，全市域、全产业链改造提升纺织、化工、金属加工三大传统产业，传承发展黄酒、珍珠两大历史经典产业，培育发展高端装备、电子信息、现代医药、新材料四大新兴产业，与此同时加快发展文商旅融合的现代服务业，高标准打造“科创大走廊”和“文创大走廊”，高水平建设国家创新型城市和人才强市，努力形成若干个具有核心竞争力的千亿级产业集群。在城市规划建设方面，将重点唱好三个层面的“双城计”，集中力量推动全市域协同发展、大市区融合发展、主城区新城古城联动发展，推进杭绍台高铁、杭绍台高速、金甬铁路、城市轨道交通<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>号线、城市快速路网等重大项目建设，加快构建现代综合立体化交通体系，加快实现绍兴与杭州、宁波同城化发展。在民生事业保障方面，将重点提升基本公共服务均等化水平，深入推进治水、治气、治土、治危、治垃圾，着力解决企业和群众关心的实际问题，努力打造全省最优的生态环境、人文环境、营商环境、宜居环境，不断满足人民美好生活需要。我们召开首届绍兴发展大会，就是要恳请所有越商、乡贤和新绍兴人凝聚起来，始终保持赤子之心、家国情怀，始终把自身发展与家乡发展紧密联系在一起，积极投资家乡、建设家乡，在自身发展壮大的同时，推动绍兴在高质量发展新征程上走得更快更稳，合力把家乡建设得更加美丽繁荣。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="BACKGROUND: white; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; MARGIN-TOP: 7.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 22.5pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; BACKGROUND: white; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">　　绍兴是天下绍兴人共同的家园，承载着浓浓乡愁和美好愿景，我们要为广大越商和乡贤反哺家乡创造最好环境，提供最优服务。一方水土养育一方人，绍兴人普遍都有“离土不离乡”的朴素情怀和家乡观念，那些魂牵梦绕的乡愁、割舍不断的乡情、永远不变的乡音，以及儿时玩耍的伙伴、小巷台门的生活，始终都是在外越商和乡贤们最难忘、最愿讲、讲得最多的言语和记忆。尤其令人感动的是，改革开放以来广大越商和乡贤情系家乡、不忘家乡、反哺家乡，积极为家乡发展献计献策、出资出智，为家乡人民的美好生活劳心劳力、无私奉献，帮助家乡办成了许多大事要事。在与外地绍兴籍企业家、专家学者的交流中，我真切地感受到许多乡贤都有着投资家乡、回报桑梓的强烈愿望。作为党委政府，我们必须肩负起加快绍兴发展的责任使命，搭建好发展平台，完善好发展政策，把家乡的环境建设得更美，把发展的氛围营造得更浓，把提供的服务提升得更优，让每一位越商和乡贤都能实现参与家乡建设、助力家乡发展的愿望，让每一位投资绍兴的新绍兴人都能感受到这片土地的厚重文化和勃勃生机。我们召开首届绍兴发展大会，就是要向所有海内外绍兴人表明，我们一定当好“店小二”，让每一位越商、乡贤和新绍兴人安心、顺心、舒心。我们也真诚希望广大越商和乡贤秉承义利双行的优良传统，富而思源、富而思报，常回家走走看看，一如既往地为家乡发展献计出力，为绍兴改革开放和现代化建设大业作出新的更大贡献。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="BACKGROUND: white; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; MARGIN-TOP: 7.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 22.5pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; BACKGROUND: white; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">　　各位越商、各位乡贤、各位嘉宾，征程万里风正劲，重任千钧再奋蹄。在新时代高质量发展的进程中，我们面临的机遇之大前所未有、挑战之大前所未有、舞台之大前所未有，我们要紧密团结在以习近平同志为核心的党中央周围，在省委、省政府坚强领导下，凝聚起拥抱大湾区、发展大绍兴的最广泛力量，解放思想，开拓创新，务实工作，努力使千年古城焕发出时代的活力、魅力和现代的时尚、特色，在建设现代化强市的征程中，谱写出更加光辉灿烂的新时代中国特色社会主义绍兴篇章！</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="BACKGROUND: white; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; MARGIN-TOP: 7.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 22.5pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; BACKGROUND: white; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">　　</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
